xt-Gen WAF\">A10 Next-Gen WAF</option>\n                                                            <option value=\"External Attack Surface Management\">External Attack Surface Management</option>\n                                                            <option value=\"RedSeal Networks\">RedSeal Networks</option>\n                                                            <option value=\"SpinOne all-in-one SaaS Security Platform\">SpinOne all-in-one SaaS Security Platform</option>\n                                                            <option value=\"InfiniGuard\">InfiniGuard</option>\n                                                            <option value=\"Labyrinth Deception Platform\">Labyrinth Deception Platform</option>\n                                                    </select><div data-id=\"ss-nzathoi0\" aria-label=\"Combobox\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"ss-main custom-select required\" role=\"combobox\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-controls=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-activedescendant=\"9y1h1osn\"><div class=\"ss-values\"><div class=\"ss-single\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Select a product</font></font></div></div><div class=\"ss-deselect ss-hide\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\"><path d=\"M10,10 L90,90 M10,90 L90,10\"></path></svg></div><svg class=\"ss-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\"><path d=\"M10,30 L50,70 L90,30\"></path></svg></div>\n                        <span class=\"form__error-message\">Виберіть продукт.</span>\n                    </label>\n\n                    <label class=\"form__label form__error-message-box\">\n                                                <div class=\"form__recaptcha cf-turnstile\" data-sitekey=\"0x4AAAAAAB0Lcp5pNr4ncuM0\" data-language=\"uk\" data-theme=\"light\"><div><template shadowrootmode=\"closed\"><iframe src=\"https://challenges.cloudflare.com/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/h/b/turnstile/if/ov2/av0/rchJ9PvIgbtTHSpnUxbwKsFTIj0_Onw_lKLsJ0b5wQVgR0-1758881333-1.3.1.1-0vvkH7WUzxRWmWtMWtB7N9ikxDiz9T77CFfYguJXjlY/tg59h/0x4AAAAAAB0Lcp5pNr4ncuM0/light/fbE/crashed_retry/normal/uk\" allow=\"cross-origin-isolated; fullscreen; autoplay\" sandbox=\"allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-popups\" id=\"cf-chl-widget-tg59h\" tabindex=\"0\" title=\"Віджет, що містить завдання безпеки Cloudflare\" style=\"border: none; overflow: hidden; width: 300px; height: 65px;\"></iframe></template><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"cf-turnstile-response\" id=\"cf-chl-widget-tg59h_response\" value=\"\"></div></div>\n                        <span class=\"form__error-message\">Заповніть капчу.</span>\n                    </label>\n\n                    <div class=\"section-partnership__form-footer\">\n                        <label class=\"form__label-box form__error-message-box\">\n            <span class=\"form__control form__checkbox\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"agree\" class=\"form__control-default form__checkbox-default required\">\n              <span class=\"form__control-custom form__checkbox-custom\"></span>\n              <svg class=\"icon form__checkbox-custom-checked\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M18.4933 6.93501C18.8053 7.20742 18.8374 7.6812 18.565 7.99324L10.7079 16.9932C10.5654 17.1564 10.3594 17.25 10.1429 17.25C9.9263 17.25 9.72031 17.1564 9.57788 16.9932L6.43502 13.3932C6.16261 13.0812 6.19473 12.6074 6.50677 12.335C6.8188 12.0626 7.29259 12.0947 7.565 12.4068L10.1429 15.3596L17.435 7.00675C17.7074 6.69472 18.1812 6.6626 18.4933 6.93501Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n                            <span class=\"form__control-text\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">I agree to the processing of personal data</font></font></span>\n                        