\n          </a><a href=\"https://iitd.ua/infodas/\" class=\"marquee__item marquee-partners__item\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><br />\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://iitd.ua/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/infodas-logo-claim.png\" alt=\"Infodas Company\" class=\"marquee-partners__image\" width=\"242\" height=\"120\" loading=\"lazy\"><br />\n          </a><a href=\"https://iitd.ua/infinidat/\" class=\"marquee__item marquee-partners__item\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><br />\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://iitd.ua/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/infinidat-logo-positive-rgb-ultraviolet-01.png\" alt=\"Infinidat Company\" class=\"marquee-partners__image\" width=\"242\" height=\"120\" loading=\"lazy\"><br />\n          </a><a href=\"https://iitd.ua/labirint/\" class=\"marquee__item marquee-partners__item\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><br />\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://iitd.ua/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/logo_dark_big.png\" alt=\"Labyrinth Company\" class=\"marquee-partners__image\" width=\"242\" height=\"120\" loading=\"lazy\"><br />\n          </a><a href=\"https://iitd.ua/cossack-labs/\" class=\"marquee__item marquee-partners__item\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><br />\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://iitd.ua/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/cossack-labs-logo.png\" alt=\"Cossack Labs\" class=\"marquee-partners__image\" width=\"242\" height=\"120\" loading=\"lazy\"><br />\n          </a></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section-seo animation-trigger animation-start\">\n<div class=\"container section-seo__container\">\n<div class=\"section-seo__content\">\n<div class=\"heading heading--h3 section-seo__heading\">\n<p><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Why do you need a DLP system?</font></font></p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"section-seo__text truncate truncate--expanded\" style=\"--truncate-height-expanded: 853px; --truncate-height: 853px;\">\n<div class=\"truncate__inner content-block\">\n<p><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Valuable data has always existed, and with it — methods of protecting it. With the advent of computer technology, data has become one of the main values ​​of corporations, the state and individuals. Data leakage is a serious problem for any bank, commercial company or government institution. The implementation of DLP security systems helps to prevent the loss of valuable information.</font></font></p>\n<p><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">DLP most often stands for data loss prevention. The term has been widely used since 2006, but the first DLP systems existed even earlier. DLP technologies, on the one hand, developed as new data loss incidents appeared, and on the other hand, they were limited by legislation.</font></font></p>\n<p><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Many DLP products are not limited to preventing leaks directly. The systems also protect data from threats — both internal and external, keep track of working hours, control their actions on servers, including remotely. This has led to the fact that some DLP systems are aimed exclusively at monitoring the corporate environment, they lack the main function — blocking data transmission. Therefore, the term DLP is sometimes used in a broad sense.</font></font></p>\n<p><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Support for DLP solutions from iIT Distribution</font></font></strong></p>\n<p><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">IT Distribution is a team of experienced Ukrainian professionals. We represent on the Ukrainian market the products of GTB Technologies, American developers who were among the first to develop DLP systems. GTB Technologies offers functional solutions, original technologies and control of a large number of protocols. As official representatives of GTB Technologies in Ukraine, we implement and support DLP solutions for Ukrainian businesses.</font></font></p>\n<p><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">The cost of a DLP system includes one-time costs when purchasing the product: expertise, development of a security policy, purchase of a license, implementation. The price of a DLP system depends on the configuration, but in general it is affordable enough to buy even for a small business.</font></font></p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n<p>      <button type=\"button\" class=\"button button--secondary section-seo__button\" data-more-button=\"\" data-readmore-less=\"Згорнути\" data-readmore-full=\"Читати далі\"><br />\n        <span class=\"section-seo__button-text\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Collapse</font></font></span></p>\n<p>        <span class=\"button__icon-box\"></p>\n<p>          <svg class=\"icon button__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <path d=\"M13.1715 12.0007L8.22168 7.05093L9.6359 5.63672L15.9999 12.0007L9.6359 18.3646L8.22168 16.9504L13.1715 12.0007Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n          </svg></p>\n<p>          <svg class=\"icon button__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <path d=\"M13.1715 12.0007L8.22168 7.05093L9.6359 5.63672L15.9999 12.0007L9.6359 18.3646L8.22168 16.9504L13.1715 12.0007Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n          </svg></p>\n<p>        </span><br />\n      </button>\n    </div>\n<div class=\"animation-wrapper section-seo__image-box\">\n<div class=\"sphere-animation\" style=\"transform: s